@* محتوای سه‌زبانه با تب — عنوان + ویرایشگر حرفه‌ای + سئو برای هر زبان + تصویر بندانگشتی/کاور *@
@inject AuthenticationStateProvider AuthState
@inject ICoreApiClient Core

<div class="lang-tabs" role="tablist">
    @foreach (var t in Tabs)
    {
        <button type="button" class="lang-tab @(Active == t.Id ? "on" : "")" @onclick="() => Active = t.Id">@t.Label</button>
    }
</div>

@foreach (var t in Tabs)
{
    @if (Active == t.Id)
    {
        <div class="form-section" style="margin-top:10px">
            <div class="form-grid">
                <label><span>@t.TitleLabel *</span><input value="@TitleFor(t.Id)" @oninput="e => SetTitle(t.Id, e.Value?.ToString())" /></label>
                @if (ShowExcerpt)
                {
                    <label><span>@t.ExcerptLabel</span><textarea value="@ExcerptFor(t.Id)" @oninput="e => SetExcerpt(t.Id, e.Value?.ToString())" rows="2"></textarea></label>
                }
            </div>
            <h4 style="margin:10px 0 4px">@t.BodyLabel</h4>
            <HtmlEditor @ref=EditorRef Value="@BodyFor(t.Id)" ValueChanged="v => SetBody(t.Id, v)" DomIdSuffix="@($"lc-{Id}-{t.Id}")" ShowImageUpload="true" />
            <details class="seo-box" style="margin-top:10px">
                <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">🔎 @SEOText("سئو (SEO)", "SEO", "SEO")</summary>
                <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:8px">
                    <label style="grid-column:1/-1">
                        <span>@SEOText("توضیحات متا (Meta Description)", "Meta description", "وصف الميتا")</span>
                        <textarea value="@SeoFor(t.Id)" @oninput="e => SetSeo(t.Id, e.Value?.ToString())" rows="2" maxlength="600"></textarea>
                    </label>
                    <label style="grid-column:1/-1">
                        <span>@SEOText("کلمات کلیدی و برچسب‌ها (با کاما جدا کنید)", "Keywords & tags (comma separated)", "الكلمات المفتاحية")</span>
                        <input value="@KeywordsFor(t.Id)" @oninput="e => SetKeywords(t.Id, e.Value?.ToString())" placeholder="تیشرت, چاپ, طرح" />
                    </label>
                </div>
            </details>
        </div>
    }
}

@if (ShowThumbnail)
{
    <div class="form-section" style="margin-top:10px">
        <h3>@ThumbTitle</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:.78rem">@ThumbHint</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(ThumbnailUrl))
            {
                <img src="@ThumbnailUrl" style="width:96px;height:96px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--border)" alt="" />
            }
            else
            {
                <span class="muted">@SEOText("تصویری انتخاب نشده", "No image", "لا صورة")</span>
            }
            <label class="btn btn-sm" style="cursor:pointer">@SEOText("بارگذاری تصویر", "Upload image", "تحميل صورة")<InputFile OnChange="PickThumb" hidden accept="image/*" /></label>
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(ThumbnailUrl))
            {
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm" @onclick="ClearThumb">🗑 @SEOText("حذف", "Remove", "حذف")</button>
            }
        </div>
    </div>
}

@code {
    [Parameter] public string TitleFa { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> TitleFaChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string TitleEn { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> TitleEnChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string TitleAr { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> TitleArChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string BodyFa { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> BodyFaChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string BodyEn { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> BodyEnChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string BodyAr { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> BodyArChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string ExcerptFa { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> ExcerptFaChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string ExcerptEn { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> ExcerptEnChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string SeoFa { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> SeoFaChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string SeoEn { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> SeoEnChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string SeoAr { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> SeoArChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string KeywordsFa { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> KeywordsFaChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string KeywordsEn { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> KeywordsEnChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string KeywordsAr { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> KeywordsArChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string? ThumbnailKey { get; set; } = ""; [Parameter] public EventCallback<string?> ThumbnailKeyChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string? ThumbnailUrl { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public bool ShowThumbnail { get; set; } = true;
    [Parameter] public bool ShowExcerpt { get; set; } = false;
    [Parameter] public string? ThumbTitle { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string? ThumbHint { get; set; }
    private string Active = "fa";
    private string Id = Guid.NewGuid().ToString("N")[..6];
    private HtmlEditor? EditorRef;

    private (string Id, string Label, string TitleLabel, string BodyLabel, string ExcerptLabel)[] Tabs =>
    [
        ("fa", "🇮🇷 محتوای فارسی", "عنوان (فارسی)", "متن محتوا (فارسی)", "خلاصه (فارسی)"),
        ("en", "🇬🇧 English content", "Title (English)", "Body (English)", "Excerpt (English)"),
        ("ar", "🇸🇦 المحتوى العربي", "العنوان (عربي)", "النص (عربي)", "المقتطف (عربي)"),
    ];

    private string TitleFor(string c) => c == "fa" ? TitleFa : c == "en" ? TitleEn : TitleAr;
    private string BodyFor(string c) => c == "fa" ? BodyFa : c == "en" ? BodyEn : BodyAr;
    private string ExcerptFor(string c) => c == "fa" ? ExcerptFa : c == "en" ? ExcerptEn : "";
    private string SeoFor(string c) => c == "fa" ? SeoFa : c == "en" ? SeoEn : SeoAr;
    private string KeywordsFor(string c) => c == "fa" ? KeywordsFa : c == "en" ? KeywordsEn : KeywordsAr;

    private Task SetTitle(string c, string? v) => c == "fa" ? TitleFaChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "") : c == "en" ? TitleEnChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "") : TitleArChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "");
    private Task SetBody(string c, string? v) => c == "fa" ? BodyFaChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "") : c == "en" ? BodyEnChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "") : BodyArChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "");
    private Task SetExcerpt(string c, string? v) => c == "fa" ? ExcerptFaChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "") : ExcerptEnChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "");
    private Task SetSeo(string c, string? v) => c == "fa" ? SeoFaChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "") : c == "en" ? SeoEnChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "") : SeoArChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "");
    private Task SetKeywords(string c, string? v) => c == "fa" ? KeywordsFaChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "") : c == "en" ? KeywordsEnChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "") : KeywordsArChanged.InvokeAsync(v ?? "");

    public Task SyncFromDom() => EditorRef != null ? EditorRef.SyncFromDom() : Task.CompletedTask;

    private async Task PickThumb(InputFileChangeEventArgs e)
    {
        var s = await Session();
        if (s is null) return;
        var f = e.File;
        await using var stream = f.OpenReadStream(maxAllowedSize: 25 * 1024 * 1024);
        using var memory = new MemoryStream();
        await stream.CopyToAsync(memory);
        memory.Position = 0;
        var r = await Core.UploadAsync("api/v1/site/images", f.Name, f.ContentType, memory, f.Size, s.Value.Token, s.Value.Company, default);
        if (r.IsSuccess)
        {
            string? key = r.Value.TryGetProperty("storageKey", out var k) ? k.GetString() : null;
            await ThumbnailKeyChanged.InvokeAsync(key);
        }
    }
    private Task ClearThumb() => ThumbnailKeyChanged.InvokeAsync(null);

    private async Task<(string Token, Guid Company)?> Session()
    {
        var user = (await AuthState.GetAuthenticationStateAsync()).User;
        return Guid.TryParse(user.FindFirst(AuthClaimTypes.CompanyId)?.Value, out var c) && user.FindFirst(AuthClaimTypes.AccessToken)?.Value is string t ? (t, c) : null;
    }
    private string SEOText(string fa, string en, string ar) => System.Globalization.CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture.TwoLetterISOLanguageName switch { "en" => en, "ar" => ar, _ => fa };
}
